24
00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:52.088 --> 00:02:52.881 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:56.843 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>玩火多危险啊 你这混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:57.427 --> 00:02:58.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:02.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
