36
00:03:31.002 --> 00:03:33.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下才是你的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.382 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我先收拾他</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:36.466 --> 00:03:39.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别着急 下一个就是你</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:39.802 --> 00:03:44.599 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
