41
00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:55.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然用逆刃刀斩断了火焰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:59.822 --> 00:04:00.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
