<c.simplifiedchinese>跟低等密探恶见可不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:26.849 --> 00:04:27.767 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 他会赢</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:28.893 --> 00:04:31.020 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不了解剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:31.688 --> 00:04:35.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是一名剑客 但不是普通的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:40.196 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
