54
00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:42.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:43.491 --> 00:04:45.827 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你连在下的一根头发都烧不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:47.328 --> 00:04:49.914 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然真的用刀防住了火焰</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:51.374 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:52.875 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不是普通的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:55.962 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他到底是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
