71
00:05:26.451 --> 00:05:28.328 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>补充完成</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:30.246 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
