89
00:06:21.506 --> 00:06:22.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:23.424 --> 00:06:26.177 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才是没有胜算的那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
