92
00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:35.144 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>像火焰一样燃烧吧 吃我的火炎拳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:37.438 --> 00:06:40.274 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架时还可以踢人</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:44.570 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的腿这么短 难怪根本想不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
