98
00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:00.461 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎么说 他们还是很强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:00.962 --> 00:07:03.172 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不仅仅是强了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:03.673 --> 00:07:05.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们俩到底是什么人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:06.008 --> 00:07:07.260 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:07.343 --> 00:07:09.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不了解他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:09.762 --> 00:07:12.265 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是我可以依赖</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:12.348 --> 00:07:13.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又引以为傲的伙伴</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:13.724 --> 00:07:14.809 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别傻笑了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:14.892 --> 00:07:16.144 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:19.188 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的浑身是伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:19.272 --> 00:07:20.982 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
