110
00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:23.943 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:24.026 --> 00:07:26.904 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂
-这可是轻而易举</c.simplifiedchinese>

