<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟恶见是冲着我来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:14.627 --> 00:13:17.296 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:17.796 --> 00:13:19.507 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然没被岔开话题</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:13:20.174 --> 00:13:22.468 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之我要离开东京</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:13:22.551 --> 00:13:25.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>碍事的人很快就会离开了 别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:13:25.763 --> 00:13:29.934 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在你的家乡会津有人在等你吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:13:31.393 --> 00:13:36.148 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>乡音难改 你说的是会津方言</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:13:36.732 --> 00:13:38.234 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下幕末时</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:13:38.317 --> 00:13:43.239 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在东京跟很多会津武士交过手
因此能听出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:13:45.699 --> 00:13:49.203 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真让人心脏受不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:13:50.162 --> 00:13:54.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多是时候说出实情了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:13:55.793 --> 00:14:01.298 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩的高荷一家是有名的医学世家</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:02.216 --> 00:14:03.259 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷一家</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:03.342 --> 00:14:07.304 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论女人还是小孩都学习医术
是十分罕见的家族</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:07.388 --> 00:14:08.722 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然身为御医</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:08.806 --> 00:14:15.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>却不论病人身份
都全心全意为他们诊治</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:16.605 --> 00:14:17.648 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:17.731 --> 00:14:22.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>严格遵守身份等级秩序的武士来说
他们是令人讨厌的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:22.194 --> 00:14:27.324 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对我们从医者来说却是理想的榜样</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:27.408 --> 00:14:31.537 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠的父亲高荷隆生更是如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:34.540 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说了西医的惊人效果后</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:14:34.623 --> 00:14:40.087 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他突然脱藩
带着全家去长崎学习西医</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:43.173 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时这要鼓起多大勇气</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:14:43.257 --> 00:14:46.594 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的年轻人不会明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:14:47.177 --> 00:14:48.012 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:14:48.095 --> 00:14:52.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们一家收到了
返回会津的特别许可 几乎同时</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:54.977 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津战争爆发了</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:14:56.145 --> 00:14:57.771 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津战争</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:14:57.855 --> 00:15:00.900 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是发生在会津藩和维新政府军之间的</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:00.983 --> 00:15:04.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>戊辰战争的第四场战役</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:04.445 --> 00:15:07.239 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩不论男女老少全力奋战</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:07.323 --> 00:15:10.618 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而城池被围</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:10.701 --> 00:15:13.329 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终于1868年9月22日投降</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:13.829 --> 00:15:14.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治维新前</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:15.039 --> 00:15:17.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩担任守护京都的职务</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:20.085 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>镇压维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:20.169 --> 00:15:21.462 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:21.545 --> 00:15:24.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会津藩人民在此后许多年里</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:15:24.214 --> 00:15:27.343 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>受到了新政府的不合理镇压</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:15:28.177 --> 00:15:29.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷一家</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:15:29.428 --> 00:15:33.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只留下年幼的惠
就投身战场做了军医</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:35.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>隆生死在了战场上</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:15:35.684 --> 00:15:39.355 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠的母亲和两个兄弟下落不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:15:40.064 --> 00:15:44.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那之后 惠就一个人孤孤单单的</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:15:46.195 --> 00:15:47.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>五年前</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:15:47.404 --> 00:15:51.158 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她来到东京 成为了某个大夫的助手</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:15:51.659 --> 00:15:56.205 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟那名大夫很熟悉 就知道了惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:15:56.288 --> 00:15:59.917 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那名大夫三年前被杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那之后她就下落不明了</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:04.046 --> 00:16:06.173 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很想跟惠姑娘见一面</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:06.256 --> 00:16:07.633 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她现在在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:12.096 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么说是啊 刚才就没看见她了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:12.179 --> 00:16:15.182 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个女人 该不会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:16.433 --> 00:16:19.979 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>五年前 我还不会看人</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:23.232 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那名大夫暗中和观柳狼狈为奸</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:16:24.191 --> 00:16:26.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳买来廉价的鸦片原料</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:16:26.944 --> 00:16:30.197 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大夫进行提炼 观柳再拿去卖</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:16:30.781 --> 00:16:32.700 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们一直合作的很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:16:33.701 --> 00:16:35.995 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到大夫做出了这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:16:37.037 --> 00:16:38.622 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家称它为“蜘蛛网”</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:16:39.123 --> 00:16:40.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>采用了特别的提炼方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:16:40.624 --> 00:16:44.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用了平时原料的一半
上瘾性却是原来的两倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:46.588 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说能赚到四倍的利润</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:16:47.297 --> 00:16:48.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果真的流通开</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:16:48.882 --> 00:16:52.052 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用五年就能让整个东京都染上毒瘾</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:16:52.136 --> 00:16:54.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要大量贩卖的观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:16:54.763 --> 00:16:57.224 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想从大夫那里问出提炼方法</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:16:57.307 --> 00:17:00.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但大夫想独占利益 不肯说</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:01.437 --> 00:17:06.358 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们争吵起来
观柳他们失手把大夫杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:06.442 --> 00:17:07.651 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为他的助手</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:07.735 --> 00:17:10.904 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是唯一知道制造方法的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:10.988 --> 00:17:13.240 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就被逼着继续制药</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:18.537 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当我意识到这不是救人性命的药</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:22.624 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是害人的毒品 我想到了死</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:17:23.125 --> 00:17:26.545 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我不能死</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:17:27.921 --> 00:17:30.382 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要我活着…还在行医…</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:17:30.466 --> 00:17:32.217 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总有一天在什么地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:36.388 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能再见到我失踪的母亲和哥哥…</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:17:37.014 --> 00:17:38.682 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着这一点希望…</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:17:38.766 --> 00:17:42.478 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>害人的药我做了三年…</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.901 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳追着惠小姐不放</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:17:48.984 --> 00:17:53.280 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是说没有其他人知道制作方法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:17:53.947 --> 00:17:56.325 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一定尽力抑制“蜘蛛网”的生产</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:17:56.408 --> 00:17:59.078 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最大限度的减少受害者的数量</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:17:59.161 --> 00:18:04.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把情感压抑在心里
自己默默背负一切 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:05.667 --> 00:18:08.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经受了三年的折磨</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:08.796 --> 00:18:12.132 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候得到原谅 获得自由了</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:13.675 --> 00:18:14.927 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:15.636 --> 00:18:18.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那群人没那么容易甩掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:19.181 --> 00:18:21.683 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最好在道场再待一些日子吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:21.767 --> 00:18:23.185 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:18:23.268 --> 00:18:25.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以吧 薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:18:34.571 --> 00:18:35.739 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:18:35.823 --> 00:18:38.200 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白孤身一人的痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:18:39.118 --> 00:18:40.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果不是有剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:18:40.744 --> 00:18:42.621 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可能会经历一样的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:18:43.122 --> 00:18:46.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来 只要想办法对付观柳就好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:18:48.085 --> 00:18:51.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是 你千万不能对剑心出手哟</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:18:51.964 --> 00:18:54.800 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然我一定毫不客气地把你扫地出门</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:02.766 --> 00:19:03.809 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:04.309 --> 00:19:07.312 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见和火男暂时用不上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:07.813 --> 00:19:08.647 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:12.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若 你的伤没事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:13.861 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:13.944 --> 00:19:15.154 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>勉强算是</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:15.863 --> 00:19:20.409 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正如首领所说 他不是泛泛之辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:20.492 --> 00:19:21.535 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:19:21.618 --> 00:19:24.121 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他接下我的拳时</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:19:24.204 --> 00:19:29.459 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
